{"crw-nogi-5385":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます。*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨夜の「乃木坂ってどこ？」は\nサードシングル選抜発表でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈は\nまだまだです。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪を割って芽を出すには\nまだまだ蓄えが必要です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表が終わったあと \n涙が溢れましたが     "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは、\n悲しいからではなく \n悔しいからでもなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ...ただ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援して下さる\nひなちまファミリーの皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつになったら、喜んでもらえる時がくるのかな...と..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭をよぎったことでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、ありがとうございます。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈はもうすでに\n前を向いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん心配しないで下さいね。。   "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、日奈は去年8月に乃木坂オーディションに受かってから、今まで一度も手を抜いていないから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常にその時を\n全力で走っていますから...    "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省すべき点があっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後悔することはないですから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのコメントを毎回楽しみに読んで、又イベント等でたくさん学ばせて頂いてます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からまた\n全力で頑張るぞぉー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PS.今日の乃木坂浪漫ぜひ、見てください☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/18/7705491/0000.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-24795":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n こんばんは(・◇・)\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RQCWTBNMBV5BJ8JTSWEKF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RQDWQN0Z167RA85E410QZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ゼッケン、武道館以来に着ました！！\n \n だんだん字が薄くなってきてたからこの前マネージゃーさんが濃く書いてくれたから新品完がでました٩꒰ ´ᆺ`꒱۶\n \n \n \n \n あといい匂いになった〜👏( ˊᵕˋ )\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 明日IMAREALさんにて、なっちょと2人からのメッセージを流して頂きます！！\n \n \n IMAREALさんに出演させて頂くのは、今回で2回目だ〜！！嬉しい😃\n \n \n \n \n \n \n ぜひ聴いてくださいね〜ଘ(੭ˊ꒳​ˋ)੭✧\n \n よしっ！じゃあ明日も頑張るぞ〜！！\n \n 気合いだ〜🔥\n \n びーばい！\n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-31544":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/02/9990314/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/02/9990314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春だ〜〜（   ＾o＾   ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/02/9990314/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかい季節がくるとワクワクしちゃいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外駆けまわりたくなっちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊園地とかに行っていっぱいはしゃぎたい。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日見つけた春です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/02/9990314/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/04/02/9990314/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-cr